    <bpmn:process id="W_W1852" name="W1852. Private Label Digital Content &amp; Ecommerce Presentation Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New SKU launch; product content update; ecommerce performance review
Frequency: Per new SKU launch (~20–30/year); quarterly content audit
Volume: ~4,000–5,000 private label SKU product pages on buildright.com.ph
Owner: Marketing Team (Digital Content)
Participants: Marketing Team, Category Manager, Merchandise Planner, Ecommerce Team
Source: workflow W1852 — Private Label Digital Content &amp; Ecommerce Presentation Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1852_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1852_Lane1" name="Marketing Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1852_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1852_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1852_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1852_Lane2" name="Ecommerce Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1852_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1852_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1852_Start4" name="New SKU launch; product content update; ecommerce performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1852_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1852_Task5" name="For new private label SKUs: Marketing Team creates ecommerce product content…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: For new private label SKUs: Marketing Team creates ecommerce product content: (a) product photography: multiple angles, lifestyle shots, close-up detail images per W316 (digital asset standards), (b) product title: optimized for search (category + brand + key specifications), (c) product description: compelling copy highlighting quality features, value positioning, and use cases; bilingual (English and Filipino), (d) specifications table: dimensions, material, weight, quantity, compatible products, (e) customer Q&amp;A section seeded with common questions, (f) &quot;Compare to National Brand&quot; feature: side-by-side specification and price comparison (where legally permissible), (g) customer review strategy: incentivize early reviews with loyalty points per W17
Responsible (R): Marketing Team
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1–2 hours/SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1852_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1852_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1852_Task6" name="Quarterly content audit: (a) Marketing Team reviews all private label product…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quarterly content audit: (a) Marketing Team reviews all private label product pages: (i) are product images current and high quality? (ii) are descriptions accurate (any specification changes from factory?), (iii) are prices current (no expired promotional pricing displayed), (iv) are customer reviews being addressed (negative reviews responded to within 48 hours), (v) search ranking: are private label products appearing in relevant category searches? (b) update or refresh underperforming content
Responsible (R): Marketing Team
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1 week/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1852_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1852_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1852_Task7" name="Ecommerce Team monitors private label online performance: (a) conversion rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ecommerce Team monitors private label online performance: (a) conversion rate: product page views → add to cart → purchase, (b) average order value: private label items in basket vs. without, (c) search ranking for key category terms, (d) customer review ratings and sentiment, (e) return rate for online private label purchases vs. in-store
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Team
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1852_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1852_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1852_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1852_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1852_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-366 (ensure controlled execution — Private Label Brand, Packaging &amp; Marketing (PA-41.3).) | - operational: Marketing Team (Digital Content) review and approval gate
Owner: Marketing Team (Digital Content)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
