        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-366 (ensure controlled execution — Private Label Brand, Packaging &amp; Marketing (PA-41.3).) | - operational: VP Merchandising review and approval gate
Owner: VP Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
